{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》自11月9日首播後引發全城熱話，陳豪與馬國明兩兄弟為爭奪陳自瑤徹底撕破臉皮。官方最新宣傳片率 …</p><p></p>\n<p>熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》自11月9日首播後引發全城熱話，陳豪與馬國明兩兄弟為爭奪陳自瑤徹底撕破臉皮。官方最新宣傳片率先曝光兩大男主角正面交鋒激烈畫面，雙方激烈互毆引爆重重危機。馬國明角色曾經改名一事意外掀起全網關注，背後竟牽扯出一段隱藏長達7年且無法挽回傷痛真相。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議角色改名瘋狂惡搞爆笑候選名</h2>\n<p>劇中馬國明飾演角色曾經改名一事意外掀起大批觀眾高度關注。由於大哥名為陳雲生而弟弟並非同姓，不少網民索性以大哥名字為靈感，為角色創作各種爆笑原名。社交平台上湧現大量討論，有人提議叫「陳雲吞」，亦有觀眾發揮諧音創意留言猜測「陳雲根」、「陳遲生」以及「史雲生」成為搞笑候選名字。原本充滿豪門恩怨與復仇陰謀嚴肅劇情，竟因網民瘋狂改圖競猜衍生出一連串幽默互動。</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》宣傳片揭陳豪互毆場面</h2>\n<p>劇集播出後官方隨即釋出震撼宣傳片段，預告中清晰可見兩兄弟爆發前所未有激烈肢體衝突。片段揭示陳豪怒火中燒，不留情面地怒斥弟弟「滾回你的龜殼裡面」及「做回你的縮頭烏龜」等極度尖銳對白。馬國明亦不甘示弱情緒失控，厲聲質問兄長為何多年來一直處處針對自己。雙方言語交鋒最終演變成大打出手，預告畫面更顯示男方慘被打至倒地不起，血脈沸騰衝突場面令原本脆弱兄弟情誼瞬間面臨崩潰邊緣。</p>\n<h2>官方片段直擊馬國明被擊倒倒地不起</h2>\n<p>針對這場引發極大迴響激烈打鬥戲份，官方透過各大宣傳渠道全面曝光兩人正面交鋒動武畫面作為回應。製作團隊在釋出片段中毫無保留地展示這場拳拳到肉肉搏戰，特意放大兩兄弟決裂瞬間震撼張力。隨著劇中夏無雙連環復仇計劃逐步推進，天誠娛樂老闆陳雲生與同母異父弟弟李德龍之間矛盾徹底白熱化。官方透過預告片預告這場豪門恩怨即將進一步升級，兄弟二人關係已經步向無法修補死胡同。</p>\n<h2>牽扯陳自瑤三角情仇成兄弟決裂導火線</h2>\n<p>兩兄弟之間恩怨情仇早於7年前已經埋下深遠伏線。當年陳雲生對關子盈一直情深一片，甚至已經準備好戒指向女方求婚。豈料他最終震驚發現心愛女人早已與同母異父弟弟李德龍秘密相戀，深受打擊下憤而將求婚戒指直接丟進垃圾桶。這段橫跨多年三角戀情成為兩人今日反目成仇最主要導火線，加上夏無雙帶著亡友日記強勢回歸並暗中挑撥，令這段糾纏不清恩怨變得更為錯綜複雜。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455742746193151_6625341976af6c5f581f85.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"frame_03.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455742746193151_6625341976af6c5f581f85.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455743211619362_14058533796af6c5fdb8823.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"frame_02.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455743211619362_14058533796af6c5fdb8823.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455745344036158_16836014426af6c60e67c90.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"frame_01.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455745344036158_16836014426af6c60e67c90.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455745682681465_20389857376af6c6114086f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"frame_05.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455745682681465_20389857376af6c6114086f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455745881212190_20194524556af6c6134b0f1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"frame_06.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455745881212190_20194524556af6c6134b0f1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455746091154294_14135714566af6c615515c2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭｜完整預告｜楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚｜TVB同行新世代節目巡禮2026｜TVB 劇集｜War Of Thorns 0-37 screenshot.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179455746091154294_14135714566af6c615515c2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%b1%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳豪</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%ac%e5%9c%8b%e6%98%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">馬國明</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3541822\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.875765+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1343,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:58:27.291342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:56.222761+00:00","content_hash":"bdb7ca4ac70d5c35bada042535d994d12270c71932e3d37962d522a2e6010da4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}